WEBVTT

00:00:02.315 --> 00:00:06.236
The Hero Association
has been greatly weakened

00:00:06.402 --> 00:00:10.490
and our greatest weapons
are yet to be unleashed.

00:00:10.949 --> 00:00:14.536
The Monster Association is poised
for an overwhelming victory,

00:00:15.411 --> 00:00:17.914
O Monster King Orochi!

00:00:18.831 --> 00:00:21.459
The only question is,
now that they are off balance...

00:00:21.668 --> 00:00:24.587
how will
the Hero Association respond?

00:00:40.937 --> 00:00:43.022
Through the once tranquil town

00:00:43.106 --> 00:00:45.400
A thunderous roar peals forth

00:00:45.441 --> 00:00:49.320
Watch out! Freak out! Monsters!

00:00:50.238 --> 00:00:52.323
Who is going to take the lead

00:00:52.448 --> 00:00:54.784
When we destroy the evil ones?

00:00:54.909 --> 00:00:59.664
Destruction, contusion...
Loosen up!

00:00:59.789 --> 00:01:01.749
We know, We are...

00:01:01.874 --> 00:01:04.460
HEROES!

00:01:04.502 --> 00:01:06.170
Why were you

00:01:06.296 --> 00:01:08.464
born of evil?

00:01:08.631 --> 00:01:10.550
If you wish to know

00:01:10.675 --> 00:01:12.969
I shall tell!

00:01:13.094 --> 00:01:18.933
This night the punching fist
of glorious justice

00:01:19.142 --> 00:01:22.437
Will shatter your fate apart!

00:01:23.730 --> 00:01:28.318
That word exists for you
and you alone

00:01:28.443 --> 00:01:32.989
Raise your silent fist
to the sky!

00:01:33.114 --> 00:01:37.660
The apostle bears
the weight of solitude

00:01:37.827 --> 00:01:43.833
For a peace not filled
with hatred

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:47.337
He must fight!

00:01:58.348 --> 00:01:59.682
Charanko!

00:01:59.849 --> 00:02:03.102
I'm going to pound true
martial spirit into you!

00:02:03.728 --> 00:02:04.354
Come at me!

00:02:05.229 --> 00:02:08.274
Charanko finishes it
with a single blow!

00:02:08.358 --> 00:02:11.319
Our four semi-finalist fighters
are now set!

00:02:11.486 --> 00:02:14.280
Which one will take
the championship?

00:02:15.365 --> 00:02:19.494
THE CLASS S HEROES

00:02:20.078 --> 00:02:21.704
Hey! You're up!

00:02:23.373 --> 00:02:25.333
Why're you holding your head?

00:02:26.626 --> 00:02:27.877
Are you nervous?

00:02:28.252 --> 00:02:29.170
Oh, mm-hmm.

00:02:29.462 --> 00:02:31.631
If I hadn't dropped
my guard in our bout,

00:02:31.881 --> 00:02:34.676
I'd be trying to keep my head
from trembling, too!

00:02:35.301 --> 00:02:37.553
The semi-final you just missed
was incredible.

00:02:37.762 --> 00:02:40.556
Suiryu won again
with a single kick!

00:02:41.057 --> 00:02:43.476
But the guy you're up against
is dangerous, too.

00:02:44.060 --> 00:02:47.605
I have him as the dark horse
of the tournament.

00:02:48.106 --> 00:02:49.649
Watch yourself, Charanko.

00:02:50.233 --> 00:02:52.819
He's acting like a good sempat
to me now...

00:02:53.861 --> 00:02:55.571
But !'m not who he thinks I arn.

00:02:58.241 --> 00:03:01.160
Watchdog Man...

00:03:02.078 --> 00:03:02.912
Here I come.

00:03:04.038 --> 00:03:05.123
Just you and me.

00:03:07.333 --> 00:03:08.084
Emergency!

00:03:08.459 --> 00:03:11.045
A group of monsters
is attacking Watchdog Plaza!

00:03:11.212 --> 00:03:11.921
What?!

00:03:12.046 --> 00:03:14.382
Other cities reporting
monster attacks as well!

00:03:17.218 --> 00:03:18.678
Let's party!

00:03:21.222 --> 00:03:22.056
Stop!

00:03:22.140 --> 00:03:23.266
Release those heroes!

00:03:23.641 --> 00:03:25.101
I, Dogman, will fight you!

00:03:30.982 --> 00:03:32.608
Is that all your poison can do?

00:03:33.609 --> 00:03:35.278
You're not a living creature,
are you?

00:03:35.403 --> 00:03:36.779
Now that you know...

00:03:38.114 --> 00:03:39.115
Self-destruct!

00:03:43.661 --> 00:03:45.955
The pilot must be somewhere!

00:03:46.456 --> 00:03:48.458
Where's the antivenom serum
for City Y?

00:03:49.000 --> 00:03:50.668
No word yet.

00:03:50.793 --> 00:03:51.794
Damn it...

00:03:52.003 --> 00:03:52.962
It'll be okay.

00:03:54.255 --> 00:03:55.757
Theyre on the move.

00:03:57.300 --> 00:03:58.134
Huh?

00:04:05.433 --> 00:04:11.272
CLASS S, RANK 9
DRIVE KNIGHT

00:04:17.236 --> 00:04:17.653
Choose.

00:04:18.821 --> 00:04:22.784
My tactical transformations cause
your death by maximum excruciation,

00:04:22.867 --> 00:04:26.496
or you die quickly and easily
by revealing all you know.

00:04:28.623 --> 00:04:31.209
You interrupted my concert.

00:04:31.667 --> 00:04:32.877
The price is your life.

00:04:38.007 --> 00:04:39.300
Found you.

00:04:39.801 --> 00:04:40.635
CLASS S, RANK 5
CHILD EMPEROR

00:04:41.427 --> 00:04:43.763
You're the one
controlling the robots.

00:04:44.514 --> 00:04:46.516
The toxin analysis is complete.

00:04:46.933 --> 00:04:49.685
If only I had my backpack on...

00:04:56.984 --> 00:04:59.153
CLASS S, RANK 10
PIG GOD

00:04:59.529 --> 00:05:00.238
Pig God!

00:05:00.530 --> 00:05:03.241
I heard explosions
and figured I'd come help.

00:05:03.699 --> 00:05:05.993
Any who interfere must die!

00:05:08.162 --> 00:05:09.330
No! She's poisonous!

00:05:09.789 --> 00:05:10.790
I'll save you!

00:05:20.424 --> 00:05:22.343
Pig God!
The venom...!

00:05:24.554 --> 00:05:26.597
No problem. Pretty tasty.

00:05:27.139 --> 00:05:29.100
Buuuu...rp.

00:05:30.268 --> 00:05:32.436
Child Emperor has sent
the antivenom formula!

00:05:32.854 --> 00:05:35.064
Good. We can treat
the poison now.

00:05:35.314 --> 00:05:38.568
Class S truly works miracles.

00:05:38.943 --> 00:05:42.238
We've come to the second
semi-final match!

00:05:42.363 --> 00:05:44.532
This is a must-see matchup!

00:05:44.866 --> 00:05:49.245
Choze, whose relentless attacks
have demolished opponents,

00:05:49.370 --> 00:05:50.788
versus Charanko,
who has advanced

00:05:50.913 --> 00:05:52.999
by winning every match
with a single blow!

00:05:53.583 --> 00:05:56.627
Hmmph! Any vulgarian can finish
an opponent with a single blow.

00:05:57.003 --> 00:06:00.047
I execute my opponents
at my own leisurely pace

00:06:00.423 --> 00:06:02.592
to showcase
my infinite superiority!

00:06:03.259 --> 00:06:05.303
My genes have been
passed down to me

00:06:05.428 --> 00:06:09.265
by the countless generations
of my bloodline, the chosen people.

00:06:09.932 --> 00:06:12.560
I am their culmination,
a genetic masterpiece!

00:06:12.852 --> 00:06:16.981
I exist as a breed completely
beyond mere fomo sapiens.

00:06:17.440 --> 00:06:19.775
Today, I declare my dominance
for all to see,

00:06:20.109 --> 00:06:22.612
but ultimately, this world
will be mine to rule!

00:06:23.487 --> 00:06:24.947
You sure got a lot to say.

00:06:25.573 --> 00:06:27.825
So you're kinda like
GMO corn or something?

00:06:29.160 --> 00:06:30.411
I will murder you.

00:06:30.953 --> 00:06:32.455
How exquisite to see

00:06:32.538 --> 00:06:35.708
your eyes filled with tears,
your mouth contorted in pain!

00:06:36.250 --> 00:06:37.126
Begin!

00:06:38.210 --> 00:06:41.297
Another single-hit knockout!

00:06:41.797 --> 00:06:45.384
Charanko advances unscathed
to the finals!

00:06:46.344 --> 00:06:47.637
The tournament's already over?

00:06:48.304 --> 00:06:51.474
Charanko's power knows no bounds!

00:06:53.684 --> 00:06:56.270
We've lost contact with
the Class A heroes in City I!

00:06:56.854 --> 00:06:58.981
Understood.
Summon a Class S—

00:06:59.065 --> 00:07:00.024
Hold it!

00:07:02.735 --> 00:07:04.111
I've been hiding under
the rubble...

00:07:07.281 --> 00:07:09.533
...Waiting for reinforcements
to get here!

00:07:09.784 --> 00:07:11.619
Now we've got all these
Class A heroes.

00:07:12.286 --> 00:07:14.163
We can handle this.

00:07:14.288 --> 00:07:15.581
No. You'll do no good.

00:07:16.707 --> 00:07:19.001
To fight a foe
with inadequate force

00:07:19.293 --> 00:07:21.671
only heightens the damage
to one's self.

00:07:21.754 --> 00:07:23.464
CLASS S, RANK 13
FLASHY FLASH

00:07:23.631 --> 00:07:25.299
You saying we're inadequate?

00:07:25.383 --> 00:07:26.759
Shut up and watch.

00:07:47.196 --> 00:07:48.864
So that's Class S power...?

00:07:59.208 --> 00:08:01.377
Isn't this causing
even greater damage?!

00:08:06.966 --> 00:08:07.508
You stop it?

00:08:07.883 --> 00:08:09.552
Just pecked at its wounds.

00:08:13.556 --> 00:08:15.641
This may call for
my ultimate technique.

00:08:28.154 --> 00:08:28.904
That's...

00:08:29.739 --> 00:08:31.198
Terrible Tornado!

00:08:49.091 --> 00:08:50.593
You there!

00:08:51.177 --> 00:08:55.765
Why're you all screwing around
when we're shorthanded?!

00:08:56.057 --> 00:08:57.433
We were fighting this octo—

00:08:57.558 --> 00:08:58.642
You especially!

00:08:58.851 --> 00:09:00.644
"Flashy Flash," was it?

00:09:01.062 --> 00:09:04.690
You're supposed to be Class S,
so start moving like one!

00:09:06.358 --> 00:09:07.568
Useless jerks.

00:09:09.653 --> 00:09:13.115
Says the air-headed woman
who dropped in to steal my kill?

00:09:13.491 --> 00:09:15.451
You presume
you're stronger than me?!

00:09:15.534 --> 00:09:16.994
Yo, what if she hears you?

00:09:17.161 --> 00:09:18.913
Don't get us in trouble with her!

00:09:21.040 --> 00:09:22.291
You forget yourself.

00:09:25.336 --> 00:09:27.213
We were no help at all...

00:09:28.547 --> 00:09:33.135
As I predicted, Class S heroes
are most troublesome.

00:09:33.302 --> 00:09:34.804
It is of no consequence.

00:09:35.638 --> 00:09:38.307
We can make
any number of monsters.

00:09:43.062 --> 00:09:46.232
You're probably all aware
of why I asked you to come.

00:09:46.482 --> 00:09:48.275
It involves the hero hunter, Garou.

00:09:49.527 --> 00:09:52.863
Silverfang is currently
pursuing him.

00:09:53.614 --> 00:09:54.990
However,

00:09:55.116 --> 00:09:58.035
it's possible Garou might
defeat the old man.

00:09:59.161 --> 00:10:01.539
Granted, Silverfang's skills
are beyond reproach.

00:10:02.206 --> 00:10:04.125
But he is up against
his former student.

00:10:04.708 --> 00:10:06.502
He might go easy on the boy.

00:10:06.836 --> 00:10:11.423
Therefore, we of the Holy Order
of the Sword will find Garou first...

00:10:11.590 --> 00:10:12.508
and kill him.

00:10:12.967 --> 00:10:14.677
To find him, we need numbers.

00:10:15.302 --> 00:10:16.554
I'm asking your help.

00:10:17.054 --> 00:10:19.765
You all are
the strongest swordsmen we have.

00:10:20.182 --> 00:10:23.060
He must be quite a threat
for you to ask this...

00:10:23.435 --> 00:10:26.355
All right. I'll send out
my disciples.

00:10:26.564 --> 00:10:27.481
Amahare...

00:10:27.565 --> 00:10:30.109
You were right to ask us.

00:10:30.359 --> 00:10:31.318
Zanbai...

00:10:31.485 --> 00:10:33.529
Consider it as good as done.

00:10:33.863 --> 00:10:34.780
Nichirin...

00:10:35.072 --> 00:10:37.158
Thank you all.
I'll make it up to—

00:10:39.702 --> 00:10:42.121
Since when is the Holy Order
of the Sword

00:10:42.454 --> 00:10:43.664
the neighborhood watch?

00:10:43.998 --> 00:10:44.874
Haragiri...

00:10:45.166 --> 00:10:47.209
Our aim is to achieve true skill.

00:10:47.459 --> 00:10:51.046
Improving our art is all
that concerns the Holy Order.

00:10:51.213 --> 00:10:53.215
Enough, you're drunk.
Let's—

00:10:53.299 --> 00:10:56.093
Quiet. I'm not done speaking.

00:10:56.760 --> 00:10:58.470
I have something special here...

00:11:01.765 --> 00:11:03.350
Monster cells.

00:11:03.642 --> 00:11:05.603
By incorporating them
into one's body,

00:11:05.728 --> 00:11:08.522
one obtains power
surpassing human limits!

00:11:10.441 --> 00:11:12.276
In other words, we can be
monsters ourselves!

00:11:12.401 --> 00:11:13.652
He's mad...

00:11:13.777 --> 00:11:14.862
Where did you get these?

00:11:15.070 --> 00:11:19.158
The monsters have formed
a Monster Association.

00:11:19.241 --> 00:11:20.951
They approached me.

00:11:21.410 --> 00:11:24.538
By surrendering my humanity,
I was allowed to join them

00:11:24.872 --> 00:11:27.833
and was given strength beyond
what this flesh could offer.

00:11:27.917 --> 00:11:29.126
Tell me you didn't...

00:11:29.293 --> 00:11:30.294
Of course I did!

00:11:30.419 --> 00:11:32.338
I am no longer some mere human.

00:11:32.713 --> 00:11:35.382
The power flowing through me
is unbelievable.

00:11:35.674 --> 00:11:38.093
Gentlemen, you must
become monsters too!

00:11:39.720 --> 00:11:41.722
You've fallen from the path,
Haragiri...

00:11:43.390 --> 00:11:47.061
With my quick draw, I can sever
all four of your heads at once.

00:11:47.853 --> 00:11:50.105
Any who refuses, dies!

00:11:51.941 --> 00:11:52.942
Unfortunate...

00:11:53.275 --> 00:11:55.778
It s unfortunate, Atomic Samurai.

00:11:55.945 --> 00:11:58.697
For I was told to kill you,
regardless.

00:11:59.073 --> 00:12:02.660
You have three seconds!
Eat the monster cells!

00:12:02.826 --> 00:12:05.287
3! 2! 1!

00:12:06.956 --> 00:12:09.708
The rest of us
aren't fools like you.

00:12:22.513 --> 00:12:23.180
We're going.

00:12:24.139 --> 00:12:25.766
But now, our target is

00:12:25.975 --> 00:12:27.643
the Monster Association.

00:12:29.061 --> 00:12:32.648
Welcome to the Super Fight
final match!

00:12:33.065 --> 00:12:36.777
The seedings had Charanko as
an overwhelming underdog,

00:12:36.860 --> 00:12:41.240
but we might have an incredible
upset on our hands!

00:12:44.201 --> 00:12:48.497
By the sound of it, the fans in
the stadium sense something, too!

00:12:48.914 --> 00:12:51.709
But this man will have no part of it!

00:12:51.875 --> 00:12:54.837
It seems unthinkable that
he'd struggle against anyone!

00:12:54.920 --> 00:12:56.839
Suiryu of the Dark Corporeal Fist
Versus...

00:12:57.089 --> 00:12:59.425
Charanko's Fist of
Seltzer Water on the Rocks!

00:12:59.842 --> 00:13:01.969
/s this guy on to my rug?

00:13:02.678 --> 00:13:05.180
Who will emerge the winner?

00:13:05.431 --> 00:13:08.183
Oh! Suiryu is grinning!

00:13:08.309 --> 00:13:10.436
Has he sensed he's got
his opponent outclassed?

00:13:10.769 --> 00:13:13.522
Charanko seems to be trying
to hide his nervousness

00:13:13.605 --> 00:13:15.190
by looking like a doofus!

00:13:15.691 --> 00:13:17.192
This is how I always look.

00:13:17.776 --> 00:13:18.485
Take your stances!

00:13:19.028 --> 00:13:20.487
Let's enjoy ourselves, Charanko.

00:13:21.030 --> 00:13:21.530
Huh?

00:13:21.655 --> 00:13:22.364
Begin!

00:13:22.656 --> 00:13:24.533
The fight begins!

00:13:25.826 --> 00:13:26.201
Watch it!

00:13:27.369 --> 00:13:29.621
Suiryu takes the offensive!

00:13:29.872 --> 00:13:32.249
But for some reason,
he stops just short!

00:13:35.169 --> 00:13:37.504
He's attacking with such speed!

00:13:38.797 --> 00:13:41.216
Since it's the finals
I wanted to see his moves,

00:13:41.508 --> 00:13:43.385
but that wind Is kinda dangerous.

00:13:43.969 --> 00:13:45.471
/s he doing that on purpose?

00:13:45.971 --> 00:13:48.724
What's the matter?
I know you can see it coming.

00:13:50.267 --> 00:13:51.560
Kick after kick!

00:13:51.685 --> 00:13:53.896
But he's stopping
just short every time!

00:13:54.146 --> 00:13:57.483
All Charanko can do
is guard his head.

00:13:57.566 --> 00:13:59.234
Has he already lost
the will to fight?

00:13:59.818 --> 00:14:01.987
The ring announcer is clueless.

00:14:02.071 --> 00:14:03.489
I was just warming up.

00:14:04.448 --> 00:14:06.909
You're strong.
I can tell...

00:14:07.076 --> 00:14:08.327
since I'm strong too.

00:14:09.870 --> 00:14:11.872
So he's not trying to
blow the wig off?

00:14:12.373 --> 00:14:13.248
It's your eyes...

00:14:13.624 --> 00:14:15.417
They aren't seeking rank or glory.

00:14:15.584 --> 00:14:17.669
Your eyes are looking
for something fun.

00:14:18.253 --> 00:14:20.172
Well...you might be right.

00:14:20.923 --> 00:14:23.509
Why'd you enter this tournament?

00:14:24.134 --> 00:14:26.136
I'm in it for the prize money.

00:14:26.595 --> 00:14:27.888
That's what I'm atter too.

00:14:28.180 --> 00:14:29.431
And I got one more reason.

00:14:30.265 --> 00:14:33.602
I want to fight good opponents.

00:14:33.977 --> 00:14:36.355
Of course, in the end,
I'm gonna win,

00:14:36.438 --> 00:14:38.023
but the process is fun,
you know?

00:14:39.066 --> 00:14:40.734
Fun...you say.

00:14:41.151 --> 00:14:43.487
Yeah. It's fun being strong.

00:14:43.737 --> 00:14:44.696
I see...

00:14:46.448 --> 00:14:49.118
I came here to experience
martial arts.

00:14:49.827 --> 00:14:51.662
I heard the fighters here
were strong,

00:14:51.870 --> 00:14:54.456
but if I fought back even a little,
the match was over.

00:14:55.249 --> 00:14:56.834
What're they gabbing about?

00:14:57.209 --> 00:15:01.130
Probably the road full of hardships
it took to come so far.

00:15:01.588 --> 00:15:04.383
I was starting to think coming here
was a waste of time,

00:15:05.300 --> 00:15:07.219
but you seem different...

00:15:09.304 --> 00:15:10.139
I see.

00:15:10.722 --> 00:15:12.558
Then how about we do it this way?

00:15:12.808 --> 00:15:15.102
I'll let you experience
martial arts,

00:15:15.185 --> 00:15:18.021
and you do your best
to make it fun for me.

00:15:18.439 --> 00:15:19.940
Oh, I like that.

00:15:20.482 --> 00:15:21.483
Okay, then...

00:15:22.317 --> 00:15:23.318
Shall we begin?

00:15:24.820 --> 00:15:25.154
Here goes!

00:15:27.531 --> 00:15:30.159
That was even faster than before!

00:15:33.328 --> 00:15:35.873
Suiryu's getting serious!

00:15:35.998 --> 00:15:36.999
I won't let up!

00:15:38.750 --> 00:15:40.669
Charanko's been launched!

00:15:45.924 --> 00:15:46.884
Safe.

00:15:48.510 --> 00:15:50.345
Down he goes!

00:15:51.680 --> 00:15:54.141
Is Charanko okay?

00:15:54.349 --> 00:15:56.059
Will he even be able to stand up?

00:15:56.351 --> 00:15:57.853
Ch-Charanko!

00:15:58.061 --> 00:16:00.647
Their ability levels were
too far apart.

00:16:01.064 --> 00:16:02.733
Did I go too hard?

00:16:02.941 --> 00:16:04.902
That last one had me scared.

00:16:06.612 --> 00:16:08.572
I thought for sure
my wig was coming off.

00:16:10.407 --> 00:16:11.033
All right.

00:16:11.492 --> 00:16:13.619
This is how it should be!

00:16:14.786 --> 00:16:16.038
He's really hanging in there!

00:16:16.538 --> 00:16:18.832
If he holds on,
his chance might come!

00:16:18.916 --> 00:16:19.875
No...

00:16:20.125 --> 00:16:21.376
Look at Suiryu.

00:16:21.752 --> 00:16:23.879
He's only been using
leg techniques.

00:16:24.087 --> 00:16:26.548
He's holding back and
toying with his prey.

00:16:27.007 --> 00:16:27.966
That means...

00:16:28.091 --> 00:16:30.052
...he hasn't gotten serious yet.

00:16:30.177 --> 00:16:32.221
Your weapon is your punch, right?

00:16:32.513 --> 00:16:33.555
C'mon, hit me.

00:16:33.680 --> 00:16:35.432
Make it fun.

00:16:41.021 --> 00:16:43.398
He read that I was going
for a countermove.

00:16:44.149 --> 00:16:47.069
He may be a white belt,
but he has real fight experience.

00:16:47.694 --> 00:16:50.531
The way he protects only
his head shows sharp instincts.

00:16:51.156 --> 00:16:53.617
What's your day job?

00:16:53.992 --> 00:16:54.952
My day job?

00:16:55.202 --> 00:16:57.913
Uh...going for walks,
defeating monsters...

00:16:58.330 --> 00:17:00.749
What? You fight monsters?

00:17:01.416 --> 00:17:03.710
It's almost as if
you're doing hero stuff.

00:17:04.086 --> 00:17:05.379
Well...

00:17:05.462 --> 00:17:07.631
I figured I might be
a hero someday.

00:17:07.965 --> 00:17:11.426
Another one aiming
to become a hero...

00:17:12.135 --> 00:17:14.638
Doesn't seem like a job
for a quality fighter.

00:17:16.515 --> 00:17:19.393
I fought a few
Class A heroes earlier,

00:17:19.601 --> 00:17:21.478
but they were so weak!

00:17:22.020 --> 00:17:23.772
They're heroes in name only.

00:17:24.565 --> 00:17:26.066
Their job is just

00:17:26.149 --> 00:17:29.152
flaunting virtue and justice
to make people feel indebted.

00:17:29.736 --> 00:17:32.322
At their level,
no matter how hard they try,

00:17:32.489 --> 00:17:34.283
they're not gonna save the world.

00:17:35.033 --> 00:17:37.953
Fine intentions, noble thoughts,

00:17:38.203 --> 00:17:41.498
lofty morals, heroic justice...

00:17:41.957 --> 00:17:44.167
They're impurities
that create boredom

00:17:44.293 --> 00:17:46.962
in the life of fun that I seek.

00:17:47.963 --> 00:17:49.548
You're strong like me,

00:17:49.631 --> 00:17:53.468
so why not live free and easy
without that crap holding you back?

00:17:54.636 --> 00:17:56.471
Huh? What'd I say?

00:17:57.139 --> 00:18:00.017
I offer advice because I see
you're one of the strong, but...

00:18:01.685 --> 00:18:03.478
A clean hit!

00:18:05.188 --> 00:18:06.189
Impurities?

00:18:07.065 --> 00:18:08.525
What's that got to do with it?

00:18:09.693 --> 00:18:12.279
You're not the only one doing
what he wants to do.

00:18:12.571 --> 00:18:13.655
Suiryu, was it?

00:18:14.531 --> 00:18:16.491
Here's some advice from me.

00:18:18.493 --> 00:18:22.289
If what you're after is having fun,
don't get any stronger.

00:18:29.046 --> 00:18:31.131
Dang, I Keep doing that...

00:18:31.214 --> 00:18:33.258
I almost ended it too quick again.

00:18:35.677 --> 00:18:37.429
— W-What the heck happened?!
— Did you see that?!

00:18:37.512 --> 00:18:39.139
Amazing!

00:18:39.222 --> 00:18:40.724
My goodness!

00:18:40.849 --> 00:18:43.393
A shocking development
regarding Charanko!

00:18:43.727 --> 00:18:47.648
He's been outed as wearing a wig!

00:18:48.357 --> 00:18:50.359
The referee is conferring
with the judges.

00:18:50.525 --> 00:18:51.652
Could this mean...

00:18:52.235 --> 00:18:54.029
I will now explain the stoppage.

00:18:54.363 --> 00:18:57.199
After the "Wolfman Incident"
of the last tournament,

00:18:57.532 --> 00:19:01.495
the rules have been changed
starting with this tournament.

00:19:01.703 --> 00:19:04.748
Masks and other head coverings
are now prohibited.

00:19:05.332 --> 00:19:08.710
His wig has been ruled
a head covering. Accordingly...

00:19:08.794 --> 00:19:10.671
Charanko is disqualified!

00:19:10.837 --> 00:19:12.214
Amazing!

00:19:12.297 --> 00:19:14.007
The match has ended!

00:19:14.299 --> 00:19:16.760
Suiryu has secured victory!

00:19:16.885 --> 00:19:19.388
— This is a joke!
— Let the match continue!

00:19:19.513 --> 00:19:23.600
Charanko's so young to be carrying
such a hidden tragedy...

00:19:23.809 --> 00:19:25.310
No, that's probably an imposter.

00:19:25.560 --> 00:19:27.604
Saitama?
What's he doing here...?

00:19:27.813 --> 00:19:29.064
You know him?

00:19:29.690 --> 00:19:32.359
We'll confirm later
you're who you claim to be.

00:19:32.734 --> 00:19:33.402
Time to go.

00:19:33.527 --> 00:19:34.861
Playtime's over.

00:19:36.530 --> 00:19:38.240
Now, we fight for real.

00:19:40.409 --> 00:19:41.368
What?!

00:19:43.662 --> 00:19:47.124
I still haven't shown you
what I can really do!

00:19:52.045 --> 00:19:54.423
The ring split in two!

00:19:55.298 --> 00:19:56.508
You're not going anywhere!

00:20:03.098 --> 00:20:06.935
Whoa! They're still fighting!

00:20:08.437 --> 00:20:10.147
I thought we were having fun?

00:20:10.605 --> 00:20:13.150
Nothing's fun about losing!

00:20:13.275 --> 00:20:15.777
— Yeah! Keep going!
— Finish him off!

00:20:15.861 --> 00:20:18.363
The crowd loves it!

00:20:18.488 --> 00:20:21.116
Suiryu seems a man possessed!

00:20:21.491 --> 00:20:23.702
I've never seen him
like this before!

00:20:24.035 --> 00:20:28.248
Now you'll understand.
This...is martial arts!

00:20:28.790 --> 00:20:31.626
Dark Body Flying Dragon Fist!

00:20:32.127 --> 00:20:35.213
He's kicking, punching,
unleashing pure fury!

00:20:35.297 --> 00:20:36.798
There's no stopping!

00:20:36.923 --> 00:20:39.259
I'm not getting to him...

00:20:42.929 --> 00:20:44.723
The ring cracked!

00:20:44.931 --> 00:20:46.433
That power stance...

00:20:46.767 --> 00:20:47.809
He's gonna kill him.

00:20:47.893 --> 00:20:48.643
Get away!

00:20:55.233 --> 00:20:56.860
That didn't...?!

00:20:57.652 --> 00:21:00.155
I see... I think I'm beginning
to understand.

00:21:00.280 --> 00:21:03.575
So I've given you an inkling
of what martial arts truly are?

00:21:04.284 --> 00:21:05.994
Martial arts are essentially...

00:21:07.245 --> 00:21:09.873
... moves that look cool.

00:21:12.417 --> 00:21:13.376
Such...

00:21:13.710 --> 00:21:14.836
... Shallowness!

00:21:15.045 --> 00:21:18.381
After everything I threw at you,
that's your conclusion?!

00:21:18.632 --> 00:21:21.510
I might try that
spinny thing you did.

00:21:21.635 --> 00:21:23.970
Defeating a monster like that
would be sweet.

00:21:24.930 --> 00:21:26.223
Don't mock me!

00:21:30.685 --> 00:21:33.271
A hip attack gets him!

00:21:33.355 --> 00:21:34.356
Oops.

00:21:34.689 --> 00:21:35.690
My belt...

00:21:36.441 --> 00:21:37.943
Well, that wasn't very cool-looking...

00:21:38.568 --> 00:21:40.612
Now! Grab him!

00:21:40.779 --> 00:21:41.738
Uh-oh.

00:21:43.657 --> 00:21:45.325
He's making a run for it!
Stop him!

00:21:45.534 --> 00:21:47.661
— Quick, the back exit!
— Catch him!

00:21:48.620 --> 00:21:50.497
For the first time in my Ife...

00:21:51.873 --> 00:21:52.833
.../ lost.

00:22:05.428 --> 00:22:10.392
We painted different dreams
into our hearts

00:22:10.517 --> 00:22:15.230
With the struggles that we faced
In the past

00:22:15.730 --> 00:22:21.236
Will the future call
or Will it slio away?

00:22:21.319 --> 00:22:26.241
There's just so much
that we don't know

00:22:26.533 --> 00:22:31.788
But one day, we'll make peace
within ourselves

00:22:32.038 --> 00:22:37.460
Weil be able to forgive
everything in our past

00:22:37.544 --> 00:22:42.632
We tell ourselves to forget
but nothing seems to fade

00:22:42.757 --> 00:22:46.761
That's what we are to each other

00:22:46.803 --> 00:22:53.059
If you hold out your hand
Youll see the bonds that show us

00:22:53.268 --> 00:22:57.606
That kindness Is the true strength

00:22:57.689 --> 00:23:04.029
Theyre something that I need
To keep on moving on

00:23:04.112 --> 00:23:09.409
So I promise that I'll come back

00:23:09.534 --> 00:23:15.290
I promise that I'll come back to you

00:23:28.970 --> 00:23:30.138
I was defeated...

00:23:32.515 --> 00:23:33.892
And I stood no chance.

00:23:34.601 --> 00:23:38.104
Among the enemy are monsters
beyond anything seen before...

00:23:41.942 --> 00:23:45.487
GOKETSU
THREAT LEVEL: DRAGON

00:23:45.779 --> 00:23:50.367
THE RESISTANCE OF THE STRONG
